# app: hackernews
# Hacker News (docs/apps/hackernews.md): lists, articles and comments from the fixtures (tests/fixtures/make-hackernews-fixtures.py,
# made-up stories). Opens on Top: thirty stories, six a page.
wait 1500
shot hackernews
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=1/5|Updated 13:34
# The arrow at the right of the bar and a swipe turn the page.
tap 480 892
wait 1500
shot hackernews-page2
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=2/5|
swipe 400 500 100 500
swipe 400 500 100 500
swipe 400 500 100 500
wait 1500
shot hackernews-last
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=5/5|
swipe 100 500 400 500
swipe 100 500 400 500
swipe 100 500 400 500
swipe 100 500 400 500
wait 1500
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=1/5|
# A tap on a story: the page it links to, as text from the reader service.
tap 270 269
wait 1500
shot hackernews-article
expect-state article=38250001|Page 1 of 4
tap 400 500
wait 1500
shot hackernews-article-page2
expect-state article=38250001|Page 2 of 4
tap 400 500
wait 1500
shot hackernews-article-page3
# "Link": the story's address as a QR code.
tap 70 917
wait 1500
shot hackernews-link
tap 148 890
wait 1500
shot hackernews-link-copied
wait 3500
# The button with the number of comments: the comments, in the site's order, replies moved right.
tap 430 917
wait 1500
shot hackernews-thread
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 1 of 5|next
# A tap on the right two thirds turns the page, on the left third turns back.
tap 400 500
wait 1500
shot hackernews-thread-page2
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 2 of 5|next
tap 400 500
wait 1500
shot hackernews-thread-code
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 3 of 5|next
tap 100 500
tap 100 500
wait 1500
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 1 of 5|next
# "Next thread": the page of the next answer to the story that starts after this page.
tap 427 917
wait 1500
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 2 of 5|next
tap 427 917
tap 427 917
wait 1500
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 4 of 5
# The last thread starts on this page: no next one. Its end is a page further.
tap 400 500
wait 1500
shot hackernews-thread-end
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 5 of 5
# "Article" from comments opened over the article: back to it, at the page it was on.
tap 70 917
wait 1500
expect-state article=38250001|Page 3 of 4
back
wait 1500
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=1/5|Updated 13:34
# A long press on a story: its comments straight away; "Article" then opens the article over them, its button goes back.
long 270 269
wait 1500
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 1 of 5|next
tap 70 917
wait 1500
expect-state article=38250001|Page 1 of 4
tap 430 917
wait 1500
expect-state story=38250001|comments=13|Page 1 of 5|next
back
wait 1500
expect-state section=top|stories=30|page=1/5|Updated 13:34
# A story with its own text (Ask HN): the text, then the comments. It links to nothing: "Link" is its page on the site.
tap 270 375
wait 1500
shot hackernews-ask
expect-state story=38250002|comments=3|
tap 70 917
wait 1500
shot hackernews-link-site
tap 394 890
wait 1500
back
wait 500
# A story nobody commented on (a long press: straight to its comments).
long 270 481
wait 1500
shot hackernews-no-comments
expect-state story=38250003|comments=0|
back
wait 500
# A story whose article can not be read: the service says why, with Retry; its comments are still a button away.
tap 270 587
wait 1500
shot hackernews-article-error
expect-state article=38250004||error=Domain 'blog.example.net' could not be resolved
# Its comments can not be read either (the search answers 503): the reason, with Retry.
tap 430 917
wait 1500
shot hackernews-thread-error
expect-state story=38250004|comments=0||error=Hacker News answered 503
back
wait 500
back
wait 500
# A site that shows the reader service a CAPTCHA: the second service (markdown.new) reads the page.
tap 270 693
wait 1500
shot hackernews-article-fallback
expect-state article=38250005|Page 1 of 2
back
wait 500
# The other lists.
tap 207 173
wait 1500
shot hackernews-new
expect-state section=new|stories=8|page=1/2|Updated 13:34
tap 480 892
wait 1500
shot hackernews-new-page2
expect-state section=new|stories=8|page=2/2|
tap 331 173
wait 1500
shot hackernews-ask-list
expect-state section=ask|stories=4|page=1/1|Updated 13:34
tap 454 173
wait 1500
expect-state section=show|stories=4|page=1/1|Updated 13:34
